  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "6656242",
      "title": "Using Services for Pushing Data from A to B",
      "lectureOrder": 445,
      "videoOrder": 408,
      "sourceHash": "5db3c61f65f8384502ff83b07df7bb892c5a9d7d8f899ebda4ce38786b20c077",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.46,
          "end": 3.293,
          "en": "Instructor: In the last lecture",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.293,
          "end": 6.18,
          "en": "we basically finished our shopping list service,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.18,
          "end": 8.85,
          "en": "but here's one thing which is not working.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.85,
          "end": 11.85,
          "en": "I can click this add button as often as I want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.85,
          "end": 13.05,
          "en": "I don't get an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.05,
          "end": 16.053,
          "en": "but I also don't see it getting added to this list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.55,
          "end": 19.41,
          "en": "The reason for this is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.41,
          "end": 21.72,
          "en": "that when we call getIngredients",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.72,
          "end": 24.333,
          "en": "which you of course do to populate this list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.752,
          "end": 27.66,
          "en": "we only get a slice of the ingredients array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.66,
          "end": 29.55,
          "en": "so we get a copy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.55,
          "end": 32.04,
          "en": "Therefore, once we add a new ingredient,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.04,
          "end": 34.17,
          "en": "which you of course don't add to the copy,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.17,
          "end": 36.39,
          "en": "but to the original array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 36.39,
          "end": 38.61,
          "en": "that is not reflected in our components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 38.61,
          "end": 41.133,
          "en": "where we only have that copy to work with.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 42.24,
          "end": 45,
          "en": "Now, there are a couple of ways of solving this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45,
          "end": 47.97,
          "en": "For the easiest solution, you could remove slides,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 47.97,
          "end": 49.92,
          "en": "and that's not necessarily bad.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 49.92,
          "end": 52.74,
          "en": "You would then simply return the original array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 52.74,
          "end": 54.33,
          "en": "and if you are sure you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 54.33,
          "end": 56.79,
          "en": "don't accidentally edit it somewhere,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 56.79,
          "end": 58.68,
          "en": "this might not be wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 58.68,
          "end": 61.23,
          "en": "I choose this approach here though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 61.23,
          "end": 63.723,
          "en": "because I want to show you a different solution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 64.59,
          "end": 67.83,
          "en": "We basically have to inform our component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 67.83,
          "end": 70.23,
          "en": "that new data is available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 70.23,
          "end": 75.15,
          "en": "So I will simply add a new event emitter here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 75.15,
          "end": 77.667,
          "en": "and I'll name it ingredientsChanged.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 79.74,
          "end": 81.21000000000001,
          "en": "And I'll set this to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 81.21000000000001,
          "end": 84.53999999999999,
          "en": "or I'll of course, set this to a new event emitter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 84.53999999999999,
          "end": 87.72,
          "en": "to be imported from @angular/core.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 87.72,
          "end": 89.97,
          "en": "This event emitter now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 89.97,
          "end": 93.24000000000001,
          "en": "can emit our ingredient array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 93.24000000000001,
          "end": 95.31,
          "en": "So the type it will pass on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 95.31,
          "end": 97.68,
          "en": "is an array of ingredients.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 97.68,
          "end": 101.16,
          "en": "And now here, whenever we change this array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 101.16,
          "end": 104.343,
          "en": "we simply call this ingredientsChanged",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 106.2,
          "end": 108.42,
          "en": "and emit a new event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 108.42,
          "end": 111.39,
          "en": "And we of course, pass a value here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 111.39,
          "end": 113.97,
          "en": "our original ingredients array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 113.97,
          "end": 118.28999999999999,
          "en": "though to be precise, again, only a copy of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 118.28999999999999,
          "end": 122.73,
          "en": "So now we always have the right ingredients array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 122.73,
          "end": 124.11,
          "en": "in the service",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 124.11,
          "end": 128.46,
          "en": "and we inform our interested components about that change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 128.46,
          "end": 131.16,
          "en": "in the event we're emitting here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 131.16,
          "end": 133.743,
          "en": "So now in the shopping list component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 135.268,
          "end": 136.23,
          "en": "besides getting the ingredients",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 136.23,
          "end": 139.05,
          "en": "at that point of time we load the app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 139.05,
          "end": 142.29,
          "en": "I also want to reach out to my shopping list service",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 142.29,
          "end": 147.29,
          "en": "and simply subscribe to that ingredientsChanged event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 147.3,
          "end": 149.76,
          "en": "So now whenever ingredients change,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 149.76,
          "end": 152.04,
          "en": "I know that I will get them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 152.04,
          "end": 154.953,
          "en": "This will be of type ingredient array here, as we learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 155.88,
          "end": 157.11,
          "en": "And now I can use them here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 157.11,
          "end": 159.24,
          "en": "in the body of this anonymous function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 159.24,
          "end": 160.743,
          "en": "I'm passing to subscribe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 161.57999999999998,
          "end": 166.29,
          "en": "and here I can now simply set this.ingredients equal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 166.29,
          "end": 168.6,
          "en": "to the ingredients I got here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 168.6,
          "end": 170.64,
          "en": "And with this change of place,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 170.64,
          "end": 174.87,
          "en": "now, if we let the application reload here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 174.87,
          "end": 176.49,
          "en": "and go to shopping list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 176.49,
          "end": 178.95,
          "en": "and now I add bread,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 178.95,
          "end": 183.24,
          "en": "and now you see it gets added here again without any issues,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 183.24,
          "end": 185.16,
          "en": "because now we're getting informed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 185.16,
          "end": 186.633,
          "en": "that something changed.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
